      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Cellular automata: one step\n\n`spread/elementary-ca` advances a 1-D row of booleans by one tick using a Wolfram rule (try 30, 90, 110, 184).\n\nHere a single-cell starting row is advanced once. Combine with `state/write-spread`/`read-spread` to grow the classic triangle over time.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Cellular automata: one step\n\n`spread/elementary-ca` advances a 1-D row of booleans by one tick using a Wolfram rule (try 30, 90, 110, 184).\n\nHere a single-cell starting row is advanced once. Combine with `state/write-spread`/`read-spread` to grow the classic triangle over time.",
